@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046
@Duplicate_Key = 7e4b0d25-8e07-4cf3-82ee-873b717fe3f0

### Account Table

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Transactions Table

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions
Accept: application/json

### Credit Transaction

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accountId": 1,
    "merchantId": 1,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "amount": 123.45,
    "cashBack": 0.12,
    "userDate": "2026-08-03T11:56:00-05:00",
    "notes": "Test Transaction",
    "idempotencyKey": "{{$guid}}"
}

### Delete Entry

DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions/9
Accept: application/json

