### Get Categories

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get Merchants

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/merchants
Accept: application/json

### Get transaction by Id

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions/2
Accept: application/json

### Bad transaction Id

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions/999
Accept: application/json

### Modify Spotify entry

PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "merchantId": 6,
  "categoryId": 12,
  "amount": -12.99,
  "cashBack": null,
  "userDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00-05:00",
  "notes": "Unborking the borked"
}

### Fix Spotify entry

PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "merchantId": 6,
  "categoryId": 12,
  "amount": -5.99,
  "cashBack": null,
  "userDate": "2025-03-21T00:00:00-05:00",
  "notes": null
}

